{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "601516eb-f891-83d6-b2b8-c0d50a0582c0",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T12:56:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:54:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Luis. I got a parking ticket for being too close to a hydrant and I think it's wrong. I want to know when my hearing is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the ticket in front of you? There should be a number near the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hold on. [pause] Sorry, I'm wiping down the counter, the cloth is squeaking. Okay, it's on the yellow slip. Starts with a P, then 4, 4, 1, 9, 0, 7."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P-4-4-1-9-0-7. Got it, pulling it up. Issued last Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday afternoon, right before the storm came in. The officer wrote that I was within ten feet. I wasn't. I was a full car length back, easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Did you take any photos of where you were parked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I took some Friday morning, with the car still there. You can see the hydrant and the bumper and the space between."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, bring those. And the hearing date, let me see. It shows a hearing set for the second Tuesday of next month, at nine in the morning. That would be February tenth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "February tenth, nine a.m. Where is that, City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:14-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall, yes. Check in at the clerk's window when you get there. Bring the ticket and your photos, and print them if you can, since phone screens are a pain in a hearing room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Printed, got it. Do I need to pay anything before then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not while the dispute is open. The ticket just sits on hold until the hearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's what I needed. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Good luck with the hydrant. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
